  "details": "1. Open a camera\n\n2. Send /usercamera/Pose at a higher rate than the framerate (2-3x for example)\n\n3. See camera keeps up\n\n4. Send /usercamera/Zoom at the same rate\n\n5. See zoom target lags behind/judders\n\nIt seems like the game processes /usercamera/Zoom events one frame at a time, rather than pulling the final state from OSC. As a result, sending zoom from external apps can result in a desync if sent too fast.",
